<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA- C.BANK ASSETS RISE IN APRIL.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA- C.BANK ASSETS RISE IN APRIL.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's central bank said on Monday that its assets rose in April to 3.777 billion litas from 3.665 billion litas, an increase of 3.1 percent.  </p>
<p>The bank also said in a statement that its foreign assets rose in the same period to 3.376 billion litas from 3.264 billion litas.</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 18</p>
